      "raw_text": "Heavy rainfall caused flooding in several parts of Manila City on Saturday afternoon, June 21.\n\nHere is the situation in some areas as of 9:50 p.m., according to the MMDA. #FloodPatrol \n\nMANILA CITY\n\nEspaña Lacson to Vicente Cruz EB/WB; Knee Deep.  NOT PASSABLE TO LIGHT VEHICLES (NPLV)\n\nJose Abad Santos Tayuman Intersection; Gutter Deep. PASSABLE TO ALL TYPES OF VEHICLES (PATV)",
